{"product_id":"i-found-you","title":"I Found You","description":"\u003cp\u003eEveryone has secrets. What if you can't remember yours? 'How long have you been sitting out here?' 'I got here yesterday.' 'Where did you come from?' 'I have no idea.' Lily has only been married for three weeks. When her new husband fails to come home from work one night, she is left stranded in a new country where she knows no one. Alice finds a man on the beach outside her house. He has no name, no jacket, no idea what he is doing there. Against her better judgement, she invites him into her home. But who is he, and how can she trust a man who has lost his memory? Two women, twenty years of secrets and a man who can't remember lie at the heart of Lisa Jewell's brilliant new novel. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:129 x 198  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Lisa Jewell \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780099599494 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 464\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43749300011161,"sku":"13RC9780099599494","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/6b906600085d3803be0f17530749e370_26122497-e0a7-43d9-a13a-4c198f2409e4.jpg?v=1705773317","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/i-found-you","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}